WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.527
The first time a manager signs in, they
create their workspace. This tutorial uses

2
00:00:07.527 --> 00:00:09.411
fictional demonstration data.

3
00:00:09.933 --> 00:00:11.997
Upload a logo, if you have one.

4
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.974
Type the workspace name. The address fills
in from the name.

5
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:21.242
You can shorten the address. Crewflow
checks that it is available, then select

6
00:00:21.242 --> 00:00:22.276
Create workspace.

7
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:28.707
Next, create your profile so your team
knows who you are, then select Complete

8
00:00:28.707 --> 00:00:29.077
setup.

9
00:00:31.933 --> 00:00:37.471
Crewflow prepares your workspace. It only
opens once everything is genuinely ready.

10
00:00:39.567 --> 00:00:42.785
Your workspace is ready, and you land on
your Dashboard.
